        {
          "id": "214723ec-05d9-396f-bbf8-50ef36a25c15",
          "content": {
            "id": "214723ec-05d9-396f-bbf8-50ef36a25c15",
            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "Alphabet stock rises, hardware stocks downgraded, Vita Coco climbs",
            "description": "<p><a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://www.yahoo.com/author/julie-hyman/?.tsrc=fin-srch\">Julie Hyman</a> examines some of the top stories on Wall Street on <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute</a>.</p>\n<p>Big Tech stocks are mixed, with Alphabet (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOG\">GOOG</a>, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/GOOGL\">GOOGL</a>) gaining as Nvidia (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/NVDA\">NVDA</a>) is under pressure.</p>\n<p>Morgan Stanley analysts downgrade hardware stocks, like Dell Technologies (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/DELL\">DELL</a>), HP (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HPQ\">HPQ</a>), and Hewlett Packard Enterprise (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/HPE\">HPE</a>).</p>\n<p>Vita Coco (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/COCO\">COCO</a>) stock climbs after the company updated its tariff impact expectations. Catch <a data-i13n=\"cpos:10;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/video/vita-coco-stock-pops-tariff-165621570.html\">Yahoo Finance's interview </a>with Vita Coco co-founder and executive chairman Michael Kirban.</p>\n<p>Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with <a data-i13n=\"cpos:11;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/market-minute/\">Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.</a></p>",
            "summary": "Julie Hyman examines some of the top stories on Wall Street on Yahoo Finance's Market Minute. Big Tech stocks are mixed, with Alphabet (GOOG, GOOGL) gaining as Nvidia (NVDA) is under pressure. Morgan Stanley analysts downgrade hardware stocks, like Dell Technologies (DELL), HP (HPQ), and Hewlett Packard Enterprise (HPE). Vita Coco (COCO) stock climbs after the company updated its tariff impact expectations. Catch Yahoo Finance's interview with Vita Coco co-founder and executive chairman Michael Kirban. Stay up to date on the latest market action, minute-by-minute, with Yahoo Finance's Market Minute.",
